WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:06.767
Cybersecurity training. Module 5. Safe browsing, email and online privacy.

2
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:14.367
Check where a link really goes before you click. A few seconds of checking is cheap.

3
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.867
A padlock means the connection is private.

4
00:00:19.233 --> 00:00:25.300
It does not mean the site is honest. Criminals use https too.

5
00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:29.733
Hover over a link to see the real address.

6
00:00:30.067 --> 00:00:32.500
Check the spelling of the domain.

7
00:00:32.833 --> 00:00:36.533
If in doubt, go to the site yourself by typing the address.

8
00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:40.800
Download only from approved sources.

9
00:00:41.133 --> 00:00:44.867
Keep client names and work details off social media.

10
00:00:45.233 --> 00:00:50.467
Do not paste work, client or personal information into public AI tools.

11
00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:55.267
Use only the channels your client approved for email, text and fax.

12
00:00:56.500 --> 00:00:57.267
Pause.

13
00:00:57.667 --> 00:00:58.500
Verify.

14
00:00:58.867 --> 00:00:59.967
Report fast.

15
00:01:00.367 --> 00:01:02.100
Now read the module.
